ents."}]},{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"h3","text":"Privacy by Design"},{"type":"p","text":"Meetily implements privacy by design principles (Article 25), with no data collection infrastructure or cloud dependencies."}]},{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"h3","text":"No DPA Required"},{"type":"p","text":"Since no data is processed by third parties, Data Processing Agreements (DPAs) with external vendors are not required for core functionality."}]},{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"h3","text":"Data Minimization"},{"type":"p","text":"Only processes audio data necessary for transcription. No excessive data collection, meeting GDPR's data minimization requirements."}]},{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"h3","text":"User Rights Support"},{"type":"p","text":"Easy compliance with data subject rights: access, portability, erasure, and modification all under your control."}]}]}]}]},{"type":"section","children":[{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"h2","text":"GDPR Principles & Meetily Alignment"},{"type":"p","text":"How Meetily satisfies key GDPR requirements"}]},{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"h3","text":"Article 5: Principles of Processing"},{"type":"div","layout":"grid-2","children":[{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"h4","text":"✅ Lawfulness, fairness, transparency"},{"type":"p","text":"Local processing with user consent ensures lawful basis"}]},{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"h4","text":"✅ Purpose limitation"},{"type":"p","text":"Data used only for meeting transcription and summaries"}]},{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"h4","text":"✅ Data minimization"},{"type":"p","text":"Only processes audio data necessary for transcription"}]},{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"h4","text":"✅ Storage limitation"},{"type":"p","text":"User controls data retention on their local devices"}]}]}]},{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"h3","text":"Article 25: Data Protection by Design"},{"type":"ul","children":[{"type":"li","text":"